*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# never, under any circumstances
*.pem
id_*
*_rsa
*_ed25519
.env
# Firmware releases are fetched onto the server by deploy/update.sh from the
# firmware repository's GitHub Releases, not committed here. Ignoring the
# version directories keeps a fetched release out of git status, and stops a
# binary being committed by accident. firmware/README.md stays tracked.
/firmware/[0-9]*/
# The avatar generator writes an HTML page beside its SVG for screenshotting.
/brand/*.html
